      "name": "non-ascii-stream/non_ascii_scroll_tick_p95_ms",
      "reason": "Accepted for 0.21.0-beta.0 because the five-sample local release snapshot is scheduler-sensitive and did not reproduce in a controlled, order-balanced 12-pair Firecracker A/B using Bun 1.3.14, Firecracker 1.16.1, and Linux 6.18.44. Comparing v0.20.1 (48710c82) with the reviewed release source (42d2b9dd), non-ASCII scroll p95 improved from 34.20ms to 29.13ms (-14.8%; paired median delta -8.56ms; HEAD slower in 3/12 pairs), while median non-ASCII scrolling remained effectively flat at +0.24ms."
    },
    {
      "name": "wrapped-cjk/wrapped_cjk_518_mount_first_frame_ms",
      "reason": "Accepted for 0.21.0-beta.0 because the local five-sample snapshot's slower mount cluster did not reproduce materially in a controlled, order-balanced 12-pair Firecracker A/B using Bun 1.3.14, Firecracker 1.16.1, and Linux 6.18.44. Comparing v0.20.1 (48710c82) with the reviewed release source (42d2b9dd), the wrapped-CJK mount median moved from 136.53ms to 143.75ms (+7.21ms/+5.3%; paired median delta +8.95ms; HEAD slower in 8/12 pairs), below the release gate's material relative threshold."
    },
